* text=auto eol=lf

*.rs text
*.py text
*.pyi text
*.toml text
*.md text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.sh text eol=lf
*.snap text

# Vector basemap data: a hundred kilobytes that every clone and every CI job needs, so it
# is a Git blob. data/README.md says so.
*.geojson text

*.png binary
*.bin binary
# No raster is committed, so these two are for the force-add that gets past .gitignore: without them
# `text=auto` above would decide, and a raster it guessed wrong about would be line-ending mangled.
*.tif binary
*.tiff binary
